SCOPE — WHAT THIS LICENSE DOES NOT COVER

1. Source PDFs. This repository is written from a local library of published
   papers which is NOT included here (the sources/ directory is excluded via
   .gitignore). Those papers remain under their respective publishers'
   copyright and are not licensed by this file.

2. Code. The book builder (book/build_book.py) is licensed separately under
   the MIT License; see LICENSE-CODE.

3. Facts and findings. Scientific results described in this wiki are the work
   of the cited researchers. This license covers the expression — the prose,
   organization, and synthesis — not the underlying findings, which are
   attributed on each page to their primary sources.
